{"config":{"lang":["en"],"separator":"[\\s\\-]+","pipeline":["stopWordFilter"],"fields":{"title":{"boost":1000.0},"text":{"boost":1.0},"tags":{"boost":1000000.0}}},"docs":[{"location":"","title":"Welcome to MkDocs","text":"<p>For full documentation visit mkdocs.org.</p>"},{"location":"#commands","title":"Commands","text":"<ul> <li><code>mkdocs new [dir-name]</code> - Create a new project.</li> <li><code>mkdocs serve</code> - Start the live-reloading docs server.</li> <li><code>mkdocs build</code> - Build the documentation site.</li> <li><code>mkdocs -h</code> - Print help message and exit.</li> </ul>"},{"location":"#project-layout","title":"Project layout","text":"<pre><code>mkdocs.yml    # The configuration file.\ndocs/\n    index.md  # The documentation homepage.\n    ...       # Other markdown pages, images and other files.\n  - \uc0ac\uc6a9 \ubc29\ubc95: 01_PyCom.md\n  - \uc548\ub0b4\ubb38\uc11c \uba54\uc778: 02_user_guide.md\n  - \uc124\uce58 \uac00\uc774\ub4dc: 03_Markdown_guide.md\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"01_PyCom/","title":"\ud14c\uc2a4\ud2b81","text":""},{"location":"01_PyCom/#pythons-command","title":"python's command","text":""},{"location":"01_PyCom/#this-is-new-file","title":"this is new file","text":"<p>test1 </p> <p>test2, \ub530\ub77c\uac00\uae30 \uc131\uacf5 </p> <p>test3 </p> <p>test4 </p> <p>test5 </p> <p>test6 </p> <pre><code>&lt;img src=\"../image/01/abc.jpg\" width=\"500\" height=\"300\" alt=\"Twilight landscape with silhouetted trees against a pale sky, a crescent moon visible above, creating a serene and peaceful atmosphere\"&gt;\n</code></pre> <p>test7, \uc131\uacf5 </p>"},{"location":"02_user_guide/","title":"\ud14c\uc2a4\ud2b82","text":"<p>\uc548\ub0b4\ubb38\uc11c \uba54\uc778</p> <p>2 test</p> <pre><code>def add(a, b):\n    return a + b\n\nprint(add(2, 3))\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"03_Markdown_guide/","title":"\ub9c8\ud06c\ub2e4\uc6b4(Markdown) \uc8fc\uc694 \ubb38\ubc95 \uc608\uc81c","text":""},{"location":"03_Markdown_guide/#1-heading","title":"1. \uc81c\ubaa9(Heading)","text":""},{"location":"03_Markdown_guide/#h1","title":"H1 \uc81c\ubaa9","text":""},{"location":"03_Markdown_guide/#h2","title":"H2 \uc81c\ubaa9","text":""},{"location":"03_Markdown_guide/#h3","title":"H3 \uc81c\ubaa9","text":""},{"location":"03_Markdown_guide/#h4","title":"H4 \uc81c\ubaa9","text":""},{"location":"03_Markdown_guide/#h5","title":"H5 \uc81c\ubaa9","text":""},{"location":"03_Markdown_guide/#h6","title":"H6 \uc81c\ubaa9","text":""},{"location":"03_Markdown_guide/#2","title":"2. \uae00\uc790 \uc2a4\ud0c0\uc77c","text":"<p>\uc77c\ubc18 \uae00\uc790 \uad75\uac8c(Bold) \uae30\uc6b8\uc784(Italic) \uad75\uac8c + \uae30\uc6b8\uc784 \\~\\~\ucde8\uc18c\uc120(Strikethrough)\\~\\~</p>"},{"location":"03_Markdown_guide/#3-list","title":"3. \ubaa9\ub85d(List)","text":""},{"location":"03_Markdown_guide/#3-1-unordered-list","title":"3-1. \uc21c\uc11c \uc5c6\ub294 \ubaa9\ub85d (Unordered List)","text":"<ul> <li>\ud56d\ubaa9 1</li> <li>\ud56d\ubaa9 2</li> <li>\ud558\uc704 \ud56d\ubaa9 2-1</li> <li>\ud558\uc704 \ud56d\ubaa9 2-2<ul> <li>\ud558\uc704 \ud56d\ubaa9 2-2-1</li> </ul> </li> <li>\ud56d\ubaa9 3</li> </ul>"},{"location":"03_Markdown_guide/#3-2-ordered-list","title":"3-2. \uc21c\uc11c \uc788\ub294 \ubaa9\ub85d (Ordered List)","text":"<ol> <li>\uccab \ubc88\uc9f8</li> <li>\ub450 \ubc88\uc9f8</li> <li>\uc138 \ubc88\uc9f8</li> <li>\uc11c\ube0c 3-1</li> <li>\uc11c\ube0c 3-2</li> </ol>"},{"location":"03_Markdown_guide/#4-link-image","title":"4. \ub9c1\ud06c(Link)\uc640 \uc774\ubbf8\uc9c0(Image)","text":""},{"location":"03_Markdown_guide/#4-1","title":"4-1. \ub9c1\ud06c","text":"<p>GitHub \ub124\uc774\ubc84</p>"},{"location":"03_Markdown_guide/#4-2","title":"4-2. \uc774\ubbf8\uc9c0","text":"<p>\uae30\ubcf8 \ub9c8\ud06c\ub2e4\uc6b4 \uc774\ubbf8\uc9c0: </p> <p>\uacbd\ub85c\uc5d0 \ub300\ud574 \uc790\uc138\ud788 \ubcf4\uae30 \uc704\ud574\uc11c \uc6f9\ud398\uc774\uc9c0\uc5d0\uc11c F12\ub97c \ub20c\ub824\uc11c \uacbd\ub85c \ud655\uc778\ud544\uc694 </p> <p>\uc77c\ubc18 \ud14d\uc2a4\ud2b8\uc640 \ube68\uac04 \uae00\uc790 \uc608\uc81c\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc774\uac83\uc740 \ud30c\ub780 \uae00\uc790 \uc608\uc81c\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc774\uac83\uc740 \ucd08\ub85d\uc0c9(#00aa00) \uae00\uc790 \uc608\uc81c\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4.</p>  \uc774 \ubb38\ub2e8 \uc804\uccb4\ub294 \uc8fc\ud669\uc0c9(#ff6600)\uc73c\ub85c \ud45c\uc2dc\ub429\ub2c8\ub2e4.   \uc5ec\ub7ec \uc904\uc744 \uc791\uc131\ud574\ub3c4 \ub3d9\uc77c\ud558\uac8c \uc801\uc6a9\ub429\ub2c8\ub2e4."},{"location":"03_Markdown_guide/#5","title":"5. \uc218\ud559\uc218\uc2dd","text":"<p>This sentence uses $` and `$ delimiters to show math inline: $<code>\\sqrt{3x-1}+(1+x)^2</code>$</p>"},{"location":"03_Markdown_guide/#6","title":"6. \ucf54\ub4dc \ube14\ub7ed \ub9cc\ub4e4\uae30","text":"<pre><code>function test() {\n  console.log(\"notice the blank line before this function?\");\n}\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"03_Markdown_guide/#6-1","title":"6-1. \uad6c\ubb38\uac15\uc870","text":"<pre><code>require 'redcarpet'\nmarkdown = Redcarpet.new(\"Hello World!\")\nputs markdown.to_html\n</code></pre> <pre><code>def add(a, b):\n    return a + b\n\nprint(add(2, 3))\n</code></pre>"}]}